window.CLOSET = [{"id":1,"brand":"Labour Union","retailer":"Labour Union","name":"HBT French Army M47 Cargo Trousers","category":"Trousers","color":"Green","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Herringbone cotton in the wide M-47 cut: roomy for a long day and fine on a plane.","price":98.0,"colorDetail":"Olive","categoryDetail":"M-47 cargo trousers","url":"https://labourunion-1986.com/collections/all-product/products/hbt-french-army-m47-cargo-trouser","img":"images/full/1.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Inspired from the 1950's French Army, This M47 cut from HBT Cotton, same wearing experiences as our P44, the ideal trouser to sport in, benefiting from the breathable feature HBT cotton has. Double front knee kept and giant ammunition side pockets make this trouser an ideal work garment. The strap adjuster has been kept on the leg opening to make sure it is a rider-friendly garment. Two back flap pockets with a safety button to keep your everyday carry stay safe. • French M47 Design • Boxy Fit • HBT Cotton Size Chart For more information on measurement please see How We Measure Size Waist Hip ","details":["Your note: Love the color and the herringbone"],"fabric":null},{"id":2,"brand":"Labour Union","retailer":"Labour Union","name":"Hunting Jacket Hikcory Stripe","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Blue","occasions":["work","dance","hang"],"why":"Light seersucker outerwear you can keep on for a dance and pack flat for a trip.","price":115.0,"colorDetail":"Hickory stripe seersucker","categoryDetail":"Seersucker hunting jacket","url":"https://labourunion-1986.com/collections/all-product/products/hunting-jacket-hikcory-stripe","img":"images/full/2.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"This 'Hickory Stripe' Hunting Jacket is a modern homage to classic 30s hunting attire, crafted from seersucker cloth and hickory stripes in a timeless summer Mediterranean style. The jacket features four pleated pockets, a string waist, a camp collar with a small notch, and a plaided cotton lining for a casual, yet sophisticated look. 30s Hunting Jacket Seersucker Four-pleated pocket #seersucker #hickory stripe #30s hunting/shooting jacket","details":["Your note: I like the material and that it is light outerwear"],"fabric":null},{"id":3,"brand":"Bronson","retailer":"Bronson","name":"Lot 920 Old Time Stripe Pants","category":"Trousers","color":"Brown","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"A vintage stripe that dresses up a plain shirt.","price":109.99,"colorDetail":"Brown stripe","categoryDetail":"Old-time stripe trousers","url":"https://bronsonshop.com/collections/pants-trousers/products/lot-920-old-time-stripe-pants","img":"images/full/3.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Model Height Weight Size 1 5'9\" / 175cm 137lbs / 62kg W29 2 5'10\" / 177cm 150lbs / 68kg W30 3/Shown 5'10\" / 178cm 160lbs / 72.5kg W31 4 5'10” / 178cm 165lbs / 75kg W32 5 5'11\" / 180cm 176lbs / 80kg W34 6 5'11” / 182cm 190lbs / 86kg W36 7 6' / 183cm 203lbs / 92kg W38 Please use this info as a general guide as measurements are approximate. Size Waist Hip W29 29.1\" / 74cm 41.7\" / 106cm W30 30.3\" / 77cm 42.5\" / 108cm W31 31.5\" / 80cm 43.3\" / 110cm W32 32.3\" / 82cm 44.1\" / 112cm W34 34.6\" / 88cm 46.1\" / 117cm W36 37.0\" / 94cm 48\" / 122cm W38 38.6\" / 98cm 50\" / 127cm Size Front Rise Back Rise W29 13","details":["Your note: Love the stripe. For the sizing would have to go a bit big and have the waist taken in."],"fabric":null},{"id":4,"brand":"Morning Witch","retailer":"Morning Witch","name":"PREORDER [KNIT SWEATER] Amanita Mushroom","category":"Knitwear","color":"Orange/Rust","occasions":["hang"],"why":"A fun pattern for a day off.","price":100.0,"colorDetail":"Amanita orange","categoryDetail":"Mushroom knit sweater","url":"https://shop.morningwitch.com/products/amanita-mushroom-knit-sweater-read-the-whole-listing","img":"images/full/4.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"This is a preorder item - it is currenly in production and is NOT at our office just yet! Fulfillment will occur somewhere around October, give or take a few weeks. More specific updates will be sent out via email or posted here as they come up! Any on-hand items ordered with this one will be shipped when the preorder item arrives with us. Knit sweaters are made with a very soft 100% cotton yarn and have embroidered details on the chest and wrists. Care instructions : Wash cold on a delicate cycle to preserve color and embroidery, and to keep the cotton from shrinking. Placing the sweater into","details":["Your note: Just a fun pattern and color","100% cotton yarn and have embroidered details on the chest and wrists"],"fabric":"100% cotton yarn and have embroidered details on the chest and wrists"},{"id":5,"brand":"Nantucket Reds","retailer":"Murray's Toggery Shop","name":"Nantucket Reds® Men's Pleated Front Pants","category":"Trousers","color":"Red","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Relaxed, double-pleated canvas that fades with wear.","price":125.0,"colorDetail":"Nantucket Red","categoryDetail":"Double-pleated cotton trousers","url":"https://www.nantucketreds.com/products/nr-mens-pleated-pants-reds?variant=170331242","img":"images/full/5.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Introduced in the 1960's by the late Philip C. Murray, the original Nantucket Reds® pants have become a symbol of island life. Inspired by the color of the sails that sailed the coast of Brittany, France, our iconic cotton canvas pants are guaranteed to fade. Details: Traditional fit, classic fuller cut through the leg and seat 100% cotton canvas Sits at waist Button closure and zip fly Slant front pockets Welt back pockets, left with button closure, right open Lined waistband and lined pockets Pre-washed Machine wash cold, hang dry Unfinished at 38\" Imported DO NOT DRY CLEAN","details":["Your note: Classic color reminiscent of cape cod, relaxed fit and double pleats. No size chart though.","100% cotton canvas Sits at waist Button closure and zip fly Slant front pockets Welt back pockets"],"fabric":"100% cotton canvas Sits at waist Button closure and zip fly Slant front pockets Welt back pockets"},{"id":6,"brand":"Scott Fraser Collection","retailer":"Scott Fraser Collection","name":"Chet knit tee","category":"Tees & Polos","color":"White/Ivory","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"A knit tee with real texture; reads as more than a tee.","price":230.0,"colorDetail":"Ivory checker","categoryDetail":"Checker knit tee","url":"https://scottfrasercollection.com/products/ivory-checker-chet-knit-t-shirt?variant=43992398790910","img":"images/full/6.jpg","hi":true,"desc":null,"details":["Your note: Super cool texture"],"fabric":null},{"id":7,"brand":"Stan Ray","retailer":"Stan Ray","name":"K Pant (Olive Rs/Poplin Mix)","category":"Trousers","color":"Green","occasions":["dance","hang","work"],"why":"Lightweight poplin fatigues with room to move.","price":65.0,"colorDetail":"Olive poplin","categoryDetail":"K-pant fatigue trousers","url":"https://www.stanray.com/products/k-pant-olive-rs-poplin-mix-25-1","img":"images/full/7.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The K Pant in Olive RS/Poplin Mix combines a classic, rugged design with modern comfort and functionality. Made from 140GSM cotton poplin, these pants offer durability and breathability, making them ideal for both casual and outdoor activities. The olive RS/Poplin mix fabric provides a distinctive, earthy tone that adds versatility to your wardrobe. Crafted from 100% cotton, these pants are designed for long-lasting wear, ensuring both comfort and practicality. The loose, relaxed fit allows for ease of movement, while the patch pocket styling adds a utilitarian touch, perfect for storing your ","details":["Your note: If on sale and it actually fits, very cool pattern with a lightweight, possibly danceable fabric","100% cotton","100% Cotton Composition Loose"],"fabric":"100% cotton"},{"id":8,"brand":"Haspel","retailer":"Haspel","name":"Sherwood Green Seersucker Stretch Swimsuit","category":"Shorts & Swim","color":"Green","occasions":["exercise","hang"],"why":"Seersucker trunks, mostly cotton, for the pool or the beach.","price":69.5,"colorDetail":"Sherwood green","categoryDetail":"Seersucker swim trunks","url":"https://www.haspel.com/products/sherwood-green-seersucker-swimsuit?variant=41236585709671","img":"images/full/8.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Seersucker your summer. No uncomfortable netting here. Only the most comfortable compression lining and the best seersucker swimwear fabric available. 44% Nylon / 25% Polyester / 25% Cotton / 6% Lycra - Quick Dry • 5\" Inseam • White Compression Lining • Tipped Drawstring • 2 Front Pockets • 1 Velcro Back Flap Pocket with Drain Holes • 1 Inside Waistband Pocket • Embroidered Logo on Left Leg • Machine Wash • Imported Return Policy","details":["Your note: 25% cotton 25% poly, but seems like the best blend I've found. Doesn't have size guide."],"fabric":"Your note: 25% cotton 25% poly, but seems like the best blend I've found. Doesn't have size guide."},{"id":9,"brand":"Blacksmith","retailer":"Blacksmith","name":"Blacksmith - Tonal Cargo Pants - Indigo Denim","category":"Trousers","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang"],"why":"Two-tone denim cargos for weekends.","price":52.0,"colorDetail":"Indigo","categoryDetail":"Tonal denim cargo trousers","url":"https://www.blacksmith-store.com/collections/blacksmith/products/blacksmith-tonal-cargo-pants-indigo-denim?variant=30988170788945","img":"images/full/9.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Upcycled Tonal Cargo Pants by Blacksmith Denim construction Ripstop contrast detail pockets Drawstring on waist and ankles Embroidered patch above rear pocket Generous sizing, relaxed fit","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":10,"brand":"Blacksmith","retailer":"Blacksmith","name":"Blacksmith - Patchwork Corduroy Shirt - Green","category":"Shirts","color":"Green","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A corduroy overshirt to wear as light outerwear.","price":62.0,"colorDetail":"Two-tone green","categoryDetail":"Patchwork corduroy overshirt","url":"https://www.blacksmith-store.com/collections/blacksmith/products/blacksmith-patchwork-corduroy-shirt-green","img":"images/full/10.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Two-tone patchwork corduroy button-up shirt, classic fit, 7 wale cotton corduroy construction, embroidered tab label on pocket, button up cuffs. If between sizes we recommend sizing up. (Centimetres) S M L XL Pit to Pit 50.5 54.5 58.5 62.5 Total Length 71 73.5 76 78.5 Shoulder Width 43.5 46 48.5 51 Sleeve Length 55 57.5 60 62.5","details":["Your note: Thinking of this as an overshirt, but the collar is a little wimpy"],"fabric":null},{"id":11,"brand":"Stan Ray","retailer":"Stan Ray","name":"A Pant (Aged Hickory Stripe)","category":"Trousers","color":"Blue","occasions":["hang","dance","work"],"why":"High-waisted, wide-legged hickory stripe: cotton that moves.","price":55.0,"colorDetail":"Aged hickory stripe","categoryDetail":"Hickory stripe painter pants","url":"https://www.stanray.com/products/a-pant-aged-hickory-stripe-25-1","img":"images/full/11.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The A Pant in Aged Hickory Stripe reimagines a workwear classic with a bold and distinctive pattern. Perfect for those who want to make a statement, the aged hickory stripe design brings a vintage-inspired aesthetic to a timeless silhouette. These trousers balance functionality with standout style, making them an ideal choice for creative and casual settings alike. Loose, Straight Work Chino Fit 240GSM Cotton Hickory Stripe Fabric Welted Back Pockets Single Chain Surge Seams 26cm Leg Opening","details":["Your note: When on sale and available in my size, these are great high waisted wide leg hickory pants"],"fabric":null},{"id":12,"brand":"Brut Clothing","retailer":"Brut Clothing","name":"REWORK® TERRITORY SHIRT","category":"Shirts","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["dance","hang","dressy"],"why":"Rayon drapes and breathes; the maps are the conversation.","price":225.0,"colorDetail":"USAF rayon maps","categoryDetail":"Map shirt","url":"https://brut-clothing.com/products/the-territory-shirt","img":"images/full/12.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"INSPIRATION : A mix of two rare shirts we have in our archive from the 1940's and 50's. The design consists of a short sleeves, a classic welt pocket, and a unique waist button flap closure. Made from original escape maps from United States Air Force. Each shirt is unique and handmade in Paris. To respect this legacy all of our rework product are made on vintage equipment.","details":["Your note: Really cool shirt made from two actual (not reproduced) USAF rayon maps"],"fabric":null},{"id":13,"brand":"Found","retailer":"Found","name":"Mosaic Pants","category":"Jeans","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["dance","hang"],"why":"Embroidered cotton jeans with some give.","price":188.0,"colorDetail":"Mosaic print","categoryDetail":"Printed mosaic jeans","url":"https://found.store/products/printed-mosaic-jeans","img":"images/full/13.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Our Mosaic Pants are inspired by traditional Indo-Aryan patterns commonly found on tapestries, rugs, and murals. These patterns often depict the presence and beauty of life and nature. The garment features a breathable yet durable cotton canvas fabric and light distressing. Unisex, Relaxed Fit. True to Size. Mid-Weight, Designed to be worn during all Seasons. Man model (Micky) is 6'1 and is wearing a size 32.","details":["Your note: Cotton embroidered pants, cool for dancing?"],"fabric":null},{"id":14,"brand":"Stan Ray","retailer":"Stan Ray","name":"Wide 5 (Stonewashed Black Denim)","category":"Jeans","color":"Black","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A wide five-pocket jean in black; goes anywhere.","price":54.0,"colorDetail":"Stonewashed black","categoryDetail":"Wide 5 jeans","url":"https://www.stanray.com/products/wide-5-stonewashed-black-denim-aw25","img":"images/full/14.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Wide 5 combines modern styling with classic durability. Made from 12oz Z Twill Denim and 100% cotton, these jeans are designed for comfort and built to last. With a Loose Fit with a slight taper for added comfort and room to move, the Wide 5 features monster back pockets for practicality and riveted front pockets for extra durability. The sturdy denim fabric ensures long-lasting wear, while the relaxed fit provides a comfortable, everyday wearability. 12oz Z Twill Denim 100% Cotton Composition 23cm Leg Opening Loose Fit Monster Back Pockets Riveted Front Pockets","details":["Your note: When they go on sale, also I like their off-white/cream color for when that's back in my size","100% cotton"],"fabric":"100% cotton"},{"id":15,"brand":"Canterbury","retailer":"Canterbury","name":"Canterbury Open Hem Stadium Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Black","occasions":["exercise","hang"],"why":"Cotton-lined track pants with a leg zip; built for warming up.","price":68.99,"colorDetail":null,"categoryDetail":"Open-hem stadium pants","url":"https://canterburyusa.com/products/canterbury-open-hem-stadium-pant?variant=43532835291287","img":"images/full/15.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"CCC Open Hem Stadium Pant Experience unparalleled comfort and support, whether you're training or unwinding, with the men's open hem stadium pants by Canterbury . The elasticated waist and drawstring cord ensure a secure fit, while the cotton inner lining provides a soft feel against your skin. With full-length zips along the outer legs, these pants can be effortlessly slipped on or off when time is of the essence. The zipped side pockets keep your valuables secure. Complete with the iconic Canterbury logo, they are a testament to your love for rugby! Feature: While they can be used for traini","details":["Your note: Cotton lining, wide leg, zipper at the leg for easy removal"],"fabric":null},{"id":16,"brand":"Standard & Strange","retailer":"Standard & Strange","name":"Night Walker Jacket - Shine Black","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Black","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"A black jacket with a shine for evenings.","price":360.0,"colorDetail":"Shine black","categoryDetail":"Night Walker jacket","url":"https://standardandstrange.com/products/night-walker-jacket-shine-black","img":"images/full/16.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"From Victorian era curiosities to early 20th century equestrian and motorcycle wear to rare WW2 era items - Black Sign garments are beautifully constructed, with a shared identity and aesthetic cohesion running through the collection to a degree we rarely see in brands focusing on reproductions & recreations. The amusingly-named Night Walker Jacket is one of Black Sign's classic evening jackets — featuring a relaxed fit, high notched lapels, a half-belted back, and tonal buttons. Made from a unique woven fabric for Fall/Winter '24, it has two hand pockets on the front with a relaxed and struct","details":["Made in Japan"],"fabric":null},{"id":17,"brand":"Chamula","retailer":"Chamula","name":"Sampler Squares Button Cardigan - Grey","category":"Knitwear","color":"Grey","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"Hand-knit merino in colour patches; a statement cardigan.","price":656.0,"colorDetail":"Grey with colour patches","categoryDetail":"Sampler squares cardigan","url":"https://www.chamulaoriginal.com/products/sampler-squares-button-cardigan-grey","img":"images/full/17.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Chamula knitwear are very warm and soft because they are made of Merino wool which comes from purebred sheep grazing in the Mexican Mountains.Chamula sweaters feel great on your skin. Mexican natives hand-knit each Chamula product one by one for a truly hand-made feeling. All production processes are done by hand such as spinning the merino yarn on small hand-built spinning wheels and hand-dyeing the rich colors so each product is one of a kind and very original. These rare qualities make Chamula the ideal garment for the winter.","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":18,"brand":"Kaptain Sunshine","retailer":"Blue Owl Workshop","name":"Walk Easy Trouser in Brown Herringbone","category":"Trousers","color":"Brown","occasions":["work","dressy"],"why":"Merino, alpaca and linen herringbone with an easy waist; travels well.","price":495.0,"colorDetail":"Brown herringbone","categoryDetail":"Walk easy trousers","url":"https://www.blueowl.us/collections/kaptain-sunshine/products/walk-easy-trouser-in-brown-herringbone?variant=41050835550266","img":"images/full/18.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Details Sizing Brand Info The Walk Easy Trouser from Kaptain Sunshine imbues elements of soft tailoring into a casual, everyday silhouette. The pants are cut from a heavily textured merino wool/alpaca tweed, slowly woven with thick yarns for a lofty feel and relaxed drape. Designed to be easily dressed up or down, the pants are satin-lined to the knee and feature a combination elasticated/drawstring waist for comfort. Cut in a relaxed tapered fit with single front pleats and a zipper fly. Relaxed tapered fit Midweight merino wool/alpaca herringbone tweed Elasticated waist with drawstring Top b","details":["Your note: Looks so cozy, merino alpaca linen blend","72% wool","21% alpaca","Made in Japan"],"fabric":"72% wool"},{"id":19,"brand":"W'menswear","retailer":"Standard & Strange","name":"Wendy Trouser - Indigo/Gold","category":"Trousers","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"Indigo denim shot with gold; a trouser with presence.","price":270.0,"colorDetail":"Indigo and gold","categoryDetail":"Wendy trousers","url":"https://standardandstrange.com/products/wendy-trouser-indigo-gold","img":"images/full/19.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"W'Menswear was founded by Lauren Yates in 2015, born out of a desire to produce high quality, heritage-inspired garments for women - with a nuanced and ever-evolving perspective on femininity at the intersections of fashion, workwear, military garments, and history. Originally operating out of a converting shipping container in Bangkok, the brand has grown substantially with each new collection, employing specialty and custom fabrics as well as partnering with local workshops & artisans. The 2024 collection, titled Diesel Fueled Defiance , is inspired by women who were on the forefront of auto","details":["Your note: These are womens and out of stock but they're cool","Made in Thailand"],"fabric":null},{"id":20,"brand":"De Bonne Facture","retailer":"No Man Walks Alone","name":"Raglan sweater in green-hued multicolor Norwegian Wool","category":"Knitwear","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["hang","work","dressy"],"why":"Norwegian wool in greens; warm enough for a winter trip.","price":565.0,"colorDetail":"Green-hued multicolour Norwegian wool","categoryDetail":"Raglan sweater","url":"https://nomanwalksalone.com/collections/bfcm2025/products/de-bonne-facture-fw25-raglan-sweater-in-green-hued-multicolor-norwegian-wool","img":"images/full/20.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"\"There is something very helpful about specifying this wool as Norwegian. It puts your mind in a completely different place than if you heard it was Italian, or French, or Scottish. But that shift of expectations is pointed, and something clicks. Yes! This heft, this unexpected but beautiful melange of yarns, this high, chunky, collar - I wouldn't quite know how to place it besides being vaguely Nordic. And like all good rustic knits, this one is just at home with outdoorsy styles as it is with the dressed-up interpretations of them.\" ---Kyle Details 100% Norwegian wool Raglan sleeves with rib","details":["Your note: Extremely cool colors","100% Norwegian wool Raglan sleeves with ribbed knit collar"],"fabric":"100% Norwegian wool Raglan sleeves with ribbed knit collar"},{"id":21,"brand":"ONI Denim","retailer":"Son of a Stag","name":"ONI Denim 222-NEP 13.7oz Extra Wide Straight Jean - One Wash","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Extra-wide straight leg in 13.7 oz nep denim.","price":299.0,"colorDetail":"One wash","categoryDetail":"Extra-wide straight jeans","url":"https://sonofastag.com/products/oni-222-nep-13-7oz-extra-wide-straight-leg-jean-one-wash?variant=55798893674873","img":"images/full/21.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Fresh on the scene from the masters of texture, ONI have created their new NEP fabric. Woven at extremely low tension on vintage looms, this 13.7oz NEP denim is lightweight and comfortable to wear. The unique neppy texture will allow for some great fading the more you wear them. The 222 shape has become a fan favourite in the denim community. Its wide leg and mid-high rise waist has proven flattering on a variety of different people. ONI's classic 5 pocket design is present, as well as: punch through copper rivets, button fly, a leather patch, and pink selvedge ID.","details":["Your note: Size 32. I think these might be the jeans"],"fabric":null},{"id":22,"brand":"Samuel Zelig","retailer":"Samuel Zelig","name":"Film Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"Embroidered trousers with a story; for going out.","price":495.0,"colorDetail":"Film embroidery","categoryDetail":"Embroidered film pants","url":"https://samuelzelig.com/products/film-pant","img":"images/full/22.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Details 8 oz cotton herringbone Triple needle seam construction Elastic waistband with interior cotton drawcord Binding on interior of waist 2 Back Pockets with vertical bar tacks Custom patches This garment has undergone a vintage wash and dye to remove all shrinkage and give it a unique sun-faded look Color: Aubergine Embroidery Color: Multi","details":["Your note: Pricey but one of the few embroidery pants that looks really cool. I like the film theme","100% Cotton Machine wash cold tumble dry low Designed in Los Angeles Imported Description Film plays a large role in our designs","Machine wash cold tumble dry low Designed in Los Angeles Imported Description Film plays a large role in our designs, but for this group we wanted to make it a prominent theme"],"fabric":"100% Cotton Machine wash cold tumble dry low Designed in Los Angeles Imported Description Film plays a large role in our designs"},{"id":23,"brand":"3sixteen","retailer":"3sixteen","name":"RS-101x ~ Relaxed Straight - Lightweight Selvedge","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Lightweight Japanese selvedge in a relaxed straight; an everyday jean.","price":250.0,"colorDetail":"Indigo","categoryDetail":"Relaxed straight selvedge jeans","url":"https://www.3sixteen.com/collections/denim/products/rs-101x-relaxed-straight-lightweight-selvedge","img":"images/full/23.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The RS-101x jean features a relaxed fit paired with a lightweight rinsed indigo Japanese selvedge denim and American construction. The RS (Relaxed Straight) cut is generous and comfortable, featuring a higher rise, plenty of room on the thigh and a wider leg opening. It's the widest cut in our lineup but is by no means a baggy fit. We designed it to be a classic relaxed straight cut jean that is sure to maintain relevance in your wardrobe for years to come. The 101x flagship denim utilized on this jean is custom woven exclusively for 3sixteen by Kuroki Mills in Okayama, Japan. The 12oz fabric ","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":24,"brand":"Yonetomi","retailer":"Son of a Stag","name":"Yonetomi Brushed Mohair Border Knit Jumper - Ivory","category":"Knitwear","color":"White/Ivory","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"Ivory mohair; soft, light and a little dressy.","price":399.0,"colorDetail":"Ivory","categoryDetail":"Mohair jumper","url":"https://sonofastag.com/products/yonetomi-85-254-023-mohair-knit-jumper-ivory","img":"images/full/24.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"We're very passionate about our knitwear here at SON OF A STAG, and this piece by our good friends at Yonetomi has certainly caught our eye. Knitted from a high mohair/wool blend this jumper has that brilliant hairy quality that mohair is known for without compromising on comfort. The retro striped pattern looks great with a variety of looks and the relaxed shape makes it an easy wear.","details":["Your note: Cool, might fit me in the length. check the brand for more."],"fabric":null},{"id":25,"brand":"Drake's","retailer":"Drake's","name":"Navy Waxed Coverall Jacket","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Blue","occasions":["work","hang"],"why":"Waxed cotton coverall; rain jacket for a city trip.","price":1175.0,"colorDetail":"Navy","categoryDetail":"Waxed cotton coverall jacket","url":"https://us.drakes.com/products/navy-waxed-cotton-coverall-jacket","img":"images/full/25.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"A resounding piece of outerwear synonymous with the protean British weather. A hearty waxed cotton composition offers unrivalled patination that will only improve with wear, while patch and stud bellows pockets provide ample utility whether strolling in town or stalking in the country. The mid-wale corduroy tab collar and soft oxford cotton lining lend a sense of comfort to a timeless and rugged jacket that is just smart enough to throw on over a suit. 100% Cotton Made in Italy Waxed Cotton Three Outer Patch Pockets with Enamel Snaps Corduroy Collar Two-Way Zip Check Lining Please contact our ","details":["Your note: A waxed jacket that might fit the chest","Made in Italy"],"fabric":null},{"id":26,"brand":"Brut Clothing","retailer":"Brut Clothing","name":"REWORK® WAX JACKET - V5","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Brown","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Reworked waxed cotton in brown and green.","price":725.0,"colorDetail":"Brown / green","categoryDetail":"Rework waxed jacket","url":"https://brut-clothing.us/products/rework%C2%AE-wax-jacket-v5-brown-green","img":"images/full/26.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The REWORK® WAX JACKET - V5 is crafted from old stock British Millerain dry waxed fabric in a patchwork style. Each jacket is one of a kind, made from vintage materials and quality hardware. Colors and shades may slightly vary from one jacket to another due to the unique nature of each piece. To honor this legacy, all of our REWORK® WAX JACKETS - V5 are cut and sewn by hand using vintage machinery in our atelier in Paris. Boxy and cropped fit. Two-way zip closure protected by a snap-button flap. Three front pockets and two large back pockets. Detachable throat latch and corduroy collar. Checke","details":["Your note: I think I would be an XL? Also color scheme is really similar to my leather bomber"],"fabric":null},{"id":27,"brand":"Scarpa","retailer":"Scarpa","name":"Mojito GTX","category":"Shoes","color":"Grey","occasions":["exercise","hang","work"],"why":"A waterproof approach shoe for rainy travel days and long walks.","price":179.95,"colorDetail":null,"categoryDetail":"Mojito GTX","url":"https://scarpa.com/products/mojito-gtx-the-urban-sneaker-for-rainy-days-leisure-and-travel-32682-200-30?variant=56048454697342","img":"images/full/27.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Waterproof lifestyle sneaker for leisure and travel","details":["Your note: Allegedly super comfy"],"fabric":null},{"id":28,"brand":"Mephisto","retailer":"Mephisto","name":"Match - Black","category":"Shoes","color":"Black","occasions":["exercise","hang","work"],"why":"Walking shoes built for all day on your feet.","price":425.0,"colorDetail":"Black","categoryDetail":"Match","url":"https://mephistousa.com/products/match-black","img":"images/full/28.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Our most iconic men’s shoe – and for good reason. The Match pairs handsome classic lines with absolutely unparalleled all-day comfort, guaranteed to become your go-to shoe for both long shifts and long trips. The unique speed lacing makes slipping them on a breeze and gives these kicks a sleek contemporary flare. A supple leather lining and unique midsole give the Match luxurious comfort and excellent arch support. Add to that our unrivaled build quality, and you’ve got footwear that’ll effortlessly (and stylishly) soak up the hours and miles for years to come.","details":["Your note: Allegedly super comfy"],"fabric":null},{"id":29,"brand":"Mephisto","retailer":"Mephisto","name":"Endrik - Light Sand","category":"Shoes","color":"Beige/Tan","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A comfortable sneaker in sand for lighter trousers.","price":174.5,"colorDetail":"Light sand","categoryDetail":"Endrik","url":"https://mephistousa.com/collections/men-sneakers/products/endrik-light-sand","img":"images/full/29.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"This sneaker has a sporty design and a great fit, giving it an elegant and original look. The SOFT-AIR midsole and SHOCK-ABSORBER help reduce shock to a minimum for a smooth, fatigue-free ride. AIR-RELAX technology respects the anatomy of the foot to prevent arch collapse. In addition to lacing, a side zip makes it easy to slip into the shoe without effort. The genuine leather lining guarantees a high standard of quality and comfort. This beige model for men features suede leather over the entire foot and smooth leather on the sides and forefoot.","details":["Your note: Should be really comfy. Pretty cool, would probably wear with lighter pants mostly"],"fabric":null},{"id":30,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"DOVER RUGGED CABLEKNIT CREWNECK SWEATER - UNDYED ANDEAN WOOL","category":"Knitwear","color":"White/Ivory","occasions":["hang","work","dressy"],"why":"Undyed cable knit; a sweater that works with everything.","price":378.0,"colorDetail":"Ecru","categoryDetail":"Rugged cable sweater","url":"https://18east.co/collections/sweaters/products/dover-rugged-cable-ecru","img":"images/full/30.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"“Earlier this year Samantha and I headed down to Lima, Peru to follow a lead on a new handloom knitwear manufacturer and were blown away with what we found. Small workshops, local yarns, generational expertise. A lot of similarities to our partners in India. We developed a handful of easy-wearing styles that will hopefully serve as a cornerstone of a growing partnership with the people and the region. We’ve been dying for the temps to drop so we could wear test the samples and, unsurprisingly, haven’t really taken them off since. Based on an incredible piece of vintage knitwear from my hometow","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":31,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Yellow British Wax Cotton Boston Parka","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Yellow/Gold","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"British waxed cotton in yellow; a rain parka that fits.","price":169.0,"colorDetail":"Yellow","categoryDetail":"Waxed cotton Boston parka","url":"https://universalworks.com/products/yellow-british-wax-cotton-boston-parka","img":"images/full/31.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Boston Parka is an oversized lightweight parka, inspired by military jackets and Scandinavian style. Generous in all its proportions, from its hood (to accommodate a hat) to the large 3D pockets. Size down for a closer fit, or adjust the sleeves and waist with the cord adjusters. Model is 6’1” with a 40” chest and a 32” waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. Based in Lancashire, England, British Millerain has been a pioneer in the manufacture of waxed cotton for well over 100 years. With a dry handle, this is not a 'wet' wax, with a synthetic application to give some water-re","details":["Your note: Actually fits, cool raincoat","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":32,"brand":"3sixteen","retailer":"3sixteen","name":"Square Toe Side Zip Boot ~ Black Calf Leather","category":"Shoes","color":"Black","occasions":["dressy","work"],"why":"A side-zip boot in black calf for dressed-up days.","price":550.0,"colorDetail":"Black calf","categoryDetail":"Square-toe side-zip boot","url":"https://www.3sixteen.com/collections/new/products/square-toe-side-zip-boot-black-calf-leather","img":"images/full/32.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Square Toe Side Zip Boot pulls design detailing from some of our favorite vintage boots. We designed them to include the square toe and side zip shape usually found on 70’s campus boots combined with the apron toe panelling detail that's often seen on 60’s Beatle boots. These boots are manufactured exclusively for us in Portugal using a vegetable tanned calf leather that will age beautifully over time. The Italian cowhide upper has a supple hand with a matte finish that will soften and mold to your foot with wear. Goodyear welt construction and a thick, textured rubber sole offer maximum c","details":["Made in Portugal"],"fabric":null},{"id":33,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"GORECKI CARGO PANT - ANCIENT OLIVE DOUBLE WEAVE JACQUARD COTTON","category":"Trousers","color":"Green","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Jacquard cotton cargos in army green.","price":178.0,"colorDetail":"Army","categoryDetail":"Jacquard cargo trousers","url":"https://18east.co/collections/all/products/gorecki-cargo-army","img":"images/full/33.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"One of our most beloved silhouettes is back. If you’ve never had a pair, trust us when we tell you that they’re about to become your favorite thing we make. Proudly made in India from an all-cotton, double weave jacquard that becomes more pronounced with each wash and wear. Machine wash cold & hang dry. Tumble drying makes the fabric more 3-dimensional and interesting but also shrinks the style slightly. This garment runs true to size. James is 6’1”, 29 waist with a 32 inseam and wears Medium.","details":["Machine wash cold & hang dry"],"fabric":null},{"id":34,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"JOSEPH COACH'S JACKET - NAVY ORGANIC COTTON SHERPA","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Blue","occasions":["hang"],"why":"Cotton sherpa on one side, coach jacket on the other.","price":378.0,"colorDetail":"Navy / ecru / orange","categoryDetail":"Reversible sherpa coach jacket","url":"https://18east.co/collections/all/products/joseph-reversible-coach-jacket-navy-ecru-orange","img":"images/full/34.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"\"We simplified this season's Joseph jacket after receiving a good amount of feedback that its reversible predecessor felt unnecessarily tight when worn fleece side in. It's now just an easy, deep pile shirt. Is it insane to take one of everything from this collection? - The Management The Joseph features boxy fit, custom-tooled button front closure, two oversized, button-through hip pockets and a nylon micro-ripstop backed turn down collar. Proudly made in India from 100% organic cotton deep pile sherpa. This style runs true to size. We recommend taking your normal alpha size or sizing up for ","details":["100% organic cotton deep pile sherpa"],"fabric":"100% organic cotton deep pile sherpa"},{"id":35,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"PILCHUCK HAND-EMBROIDERED OVERSHIRT - CLAY / BUTTER /TANGERINE / FOG / ECRU / LAVENDAR COTTON FLANNEL WITH KANTHA STITCHING","category":"Shirts","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A flannel with embroidery; warm enough for a shirt-jacket.","price":268.0,"colorDetail":"Clay / lavender / ecru","categoryDetail":"Embroidered flannel shirt","url":"https://18east.co/collections/all/products/embroidered-pilchuck-flannel-clay-lavender-ecru","img":"images/full/35.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Embroidered entirely by hand with butter-hued cotton yarn, the Pilchuck is a subtly handcraft-focused update to our Caleb straight hem work shirt with two open top patch pockets and hidden hip pockets on the side seams. Great fit, fabric and details on this one. Proudly made in India from 100% cotton twill flannel. We recommend taking your usual alpha size on this style.","details":["100% cotton twill flannel"],"fabric":"100% cotton twill flannel"},{"id":36,"brand":"ONI Denim","retailer":"Son of a Stag","name":"ONI Denim 822ZR-LBR 20oz Brown Weft 'Secret Denim' Extra Wide Tapered Jean - One Wash","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Relaxed through the hip with a gentle taper; brown weft denim.","price":329.0,"colorDetail":"Brown weft","categoryDetail":"822LZ relaxed jeans","url":"https://sonofastag.com/products/oni-denim-822lz-lbr","img":"images/full/36.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The 822 silhouette showcases a super wide tapered fit, ideal if you like a lot of room in the thighs. This special denim boasts a classic 5 pocket design and ONI's usual deer skin leather patch packs its signature punch. Weighing in at 20 ounces, this denim features an indigo ward and a light brown weft, and has been woven on vintage shuttle looms on a super-low tension to achieve a finish which is perfectly imperfect.","details":["Your note: Relaxed fit but with a reasonable taper"],"fabric":null},{"id":37,"brand":"Full Count","retailer":"Full Count","name":"0105SSW - Wide Denim (Super Smooth) -","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A wide, plain Japanese jean for normal days.","price":365.0,"colorDetail":"Indigo","categoryDetail":"0105 wide jeans","url":"https://fullcount.co/collections/0105-silhouette/products/0105ssw","img":"images/full/37.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"11.5oz Original Selvedge Denim 0105 Wide Silhouette Zimbabwean cotton 100% Made in Okayama, Japan. For the best fit, we recommend measuring a similar jean, jacket, or shirt you own. Fullcount has always prioritized stress-free comfort, and has offered our 13.7oz denim as our flagship material for many years. While maintaining that same fade potential, we have now created a lighter and softer 11.5oz SS denim. Aside from being ridiculously comfortable, this material also nicely reproduces that unique look you find in vintage items. When this fabric was done, expectations ran high that we had cre","details":["Your note: For when I want a normal jean, size 31","100% Made in Okayama","Made in Okayama"],"fabric":"100% Made in Okayama"},{"id":38,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Wander etc. FD/08 Low in Black Asphalt/Gum Hairy Suede","category":"Shoes","color":"Black","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Hairy suede on a gum sole; odd in a good way.","price":99.0,"colorDetail":"Black asphalt hairy suede","categoryDetail":"Wander FD-08","url":"https://universalworks.com/products/low-black-asphalt-gum-hairy-suede-wander-fd-08","img":"images/full/38.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"wander .etc is a shoe brand from Indonesia, offering urban footwear that combines style, practicality, and comfort for various situations. The FD/08 low is a lower version of the FD/08, with slimmer laces, featuring a traditional suede upper and Wander's staple chunky sole. *Please note - UK 4 - 8 fit true to size, UK9 - UK12 we recommend you size up one size.*","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":39,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Navy Derby Stripe Duke Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Blue","occasions":["dance","work","hang"],"why":"Seersucker that fits; cool on a dance floor and on a plane.","price":69.0,"colorDetail":"Navy derby stripe seersucker","categoryDetail":"Duke pants","url":"https://universalworks.com/products/navy-derby-stripe-duke-pant","img":"images/full/39.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"A wide-leg pant with slight taper, the Duke pants have a single pleat front, a fixed waistband and two rear back pockets. Model is 6’1” with a 40” chest and a 32” waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. A classic seersucker, woven with varying tension to create the classic seersucker structure. In 100% cotton, with subtle tonal stripes. • Wide leg. • Slight taper. • Single pleat front. • Two rear patch pockets. • Two front hand pockets with internal ticket pocket. • Button fly. • Fabric Content: 100% Cotton. • Washcare: Wash at 30 degrees. Do not bleach. Do not tumble dry. War","details":["Your note: Seersucker that will actually fit me, could be good dancing","100% cotton","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% cotton"},{"id":40,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Brown Kennedy Stripe Duke Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Brown","occasions":["dance","work","hang"],"why":"Light brown seersucker with a stripe; breathes.","price":85.0,"colorDetail":"Brown Kennedy stripe seersucker","categoryDetail":"Duke pants","url":"https://universalworks.com/products/brown-kennedy-stripe-duke-pant","img":"images/full/40.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"A wide-leg pant with slight taper, the Duke pants have a single pleat front, a fixed waistband and two rear back pockets. Model is 6’0\" with a 37\" chest and a 30.5\" waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. A summer classic, an American-style, casual suiting fabric, synonymous with the Preppy look. • Wide leg. • Slight taper. • Single pleat front. • Two rear patch pockets. • Two front hand pockets with internal ticket pocket. • Button fly. • Fabric Content: 100% Cotton. • Washcare: Wash at 30 degrees. Do not bleach. Do not tumble dry. Warm iron. Do not dry clean. • Please be awa","details":["Your note: Seersucker in a light brown with a stripe","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":41,"brand":"Universal Surplus","retailer":"Universal Surplus","name":"UNIVERSAL FRENCH PARATROOPER PANTS - BLACK","category":"Trousers","color":"Black","occasions":["hang"],"why":"Paratrooper pants in black; specific, and cool.","price":225.0,"colorDetail":"Black","categoryDetail":"French paratrooper pants","url":"https://universal-surplus.com/collections/collection-universal-surplus/products/universal-french-paratrooper-pants-black?variant=51829160214856","img":"images/full/41.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"DESCRIPTION Developed for French airborne troops and used during the Indochina War in the early 1950s, these jump trousers were built specifically for parachute operations and jungle combat. Worn by paratroopers including Foreign Legion units, they combine durability, mobility, and equipment carrying capacity in a purpose driven design. Produced in green grey and in early French lizard camouflage, the pants feature large high placed cargo pockets accessible under webbing, reinforced knees and seat, and adjustment tabs to secure the fit during jumps. The cut is roomy and functional, shaped by r","details":["Your note: The measurements are not all available but I think they would fit and they are cool but pretty specific.","Made in China"],"fabric":null},{"id":42,"brand":"Brut Clothing","retailer":"Brut Clothing","name":"THE RAIN CROPPED JACKET","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Green","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A cropped rain jacket that should actually fit.","price":460.0,"colorDetail":"Forest green","categoryDetail":"Cropped rain jacket","url":"https://brut-clothing.us/products/the-rain-cropped-jacket-forest-green?variant=52723545342285","img":"images/full/42.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Technical reinterpretation from our vintage archives. The RAIN CROPPED JACKET is crafted from waterproof 3 layers fabric. Hidden air vents make this jacket not only waterproof and windproof, but also highly breathable.","details":["Your note: Rain jacket that should actually fit"],"fabric":null},{"id":43,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"FOLA V-NECK CARDIGAN\n - MIRKWOOD GREEN REVERSE BOUCLÉ BLENDED WOOL","category":"Knitwear","color":"Green","occasions":["hang","work","dressy"],"why":"A marled green cardigan for layering on trips.","price":318.0,"colorDetail":"Dark green marl","categoryDetail":"Fola cardigan","url":"https://18east.co/collections/sweaters/products/fola-cardigan-dark-green","img":"images/full/43.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Fola cardigan returns as a proper sweater this fall. It features a narrow ribbed placket, patch pockets at the hips (plus a hidden one on the inside) and a cropped, relaxed fit. Proudly made in India from an ecru, blended woolen boucle yarn that we dyed a beautiful shade of grayish green and then ran inside out to highlight the color variation that comes from the synthetic yarns resisting the green dye. This garment runs oversized, but we recommend taking your normal alpha size","details":["Your note: very cool"],"fabric":null},{"id":44,"brand":"Indi + Ash","retailer":"Kaidu Utility","name":"Study Jacket - Ticking Stripe - 2 (S), 3(M), 4(L)","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Blue","occasions":["dressy","work"],"why":"The jacket half of a handwoven ticking-stripe suit.","price":278.0,"colorDetail":"Ticking stripe","categoryDetail":"Study jacket","url":"https://www.kaidutility.com/collections/jackets-by-other-makers/products/study-jacket-ticking-stripe-2s-3m-4l","img":"images/full/44.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Brand: Indi + Ash Made in handwoven canvas with ticking stripe pattern. Plant based dyed. Size chart: - Size 2 (S): Shoulder 17 1/2\", chest 43\", front length 28\". Sleeve length from shoulder seam: 25\". - Size 3 (M): Shoulder: 18\", chest 4 5 \", front length 28 \". Sleeve length from shoulder seam: 25 1/2\". - Size 4 (L): Shoulder: 18\", chest 4 8 \", front length 28 1/2 \". Sleeve length from shoulder seam: 26\".","details":["Your note: Nontraditional suiting option"],"fabric":null},{"id":45,"brand":"Manresa","retailer":"Manresa","name":"The Ram Island Shorts in Navy Seersucker","category":"Shorts & Swim","color":"Blue","occasions":["hang","dance"],"why":"Seersucker shorts with interesting pockets.","price":125.0,"colorDetail":"Navy seersucker","categoryDetail":"Ram Island shorts","url":"https://manresaclothing.com/products/fw25-ram-island-seersucker-navy?variant=47869316563184","img":"images/full/45.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Our best selling short, now made in beautiful Japanese summer weight seersucker with blue oyster shell buttons throughout. Cut and sewn right here in Bridgeport, Conn. Jonny is a 34 waist wearing a large for a true fit.","details":["Your note: When this is back in stock I think it is a short that would fit me (and has interesting pockets)"],"fabric":null},{"id":46,"brand":"18 East","retailer":"18 East","name":"CALISTO DOUBLE PLEATED BIG JEANS - 13 oz. RAW DENIM","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work","dressy"],"why":"Double-pleated big jeans in raw indigo.","price":228.0,"colorDetail":"Raw indigo / tobacco","categoryDetail":"Calisto pleated jeans","url":"https://18east.co/collections/all/products/calisto-pleated-denim-raw-indigo-tobacco?variant=42166761947218","img":"images/full/46.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"“I spent a lot of time at Bar S. Calisto in 2001, though we called it by a different name (and I don’t think Heroin would be a suitable moniker for double pleated denim trousers). Trastevere left a different impression in those days, but I’ll always have a soft spot for S. Calisto. As for the jeans, they’re the roomiest we’ve ever made, with a high rise, full-cut, double pleated top block and a tapered leg. You’ll be thankful for the elastic half back post-dinner, because you just had to take the Griccia AND the Scottadito. Great choices all around.” - The Management Proudly made in India. The","details":[],"fabric":null},{"id":47,"brand":"Todd Snyder","retailer":"Todd Snyder","name":"Denim Big Pant","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang"],"why":"A giant-fit jean, on sale.","price":114.0,"colorDetail":"Blue","categoryDetail":"Giant fit jeans","url":"https://www.toddsnyder.com/collections/sale/products/giant-fit-jeanblue","img":"images/full/47.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Embrace the oversized trend with this extra-wide pant. Our largest silhouette, these are 3.5” wider at the cuff than our standard Relaxed jeans, and are designed to puddle a bit at the ankle; the rise is also higher, measuring 14.5” in the front. They feature adjustable tabs at the sides of the waist, so you can wear them higher or lower as you’d like. They’re crafted from a 13.5 oz denim, with a unique resin wash that gives it the chic, structured look of raw denim. Try wearing them with a boxy or slightly cropped top, or go full oversized with one of our Big Shirts. 100% Cotton Relaxed Fit 1","details":["Your note: Cool on sale"],"fabric":null},{"id":48,"brand":"Labour Union","retailer":"Labour Union","name":"Duck Canvas Work Pants Totem Prints","category":"Trousers","color":"Multi/Print","occasions":["hang"],"why":"Duck canvas work pants in a totem print.","price":112.0,"colorDetail":"Totem print","categoryDetail":"Totem print work pants","url":"https://labourunion-1986.com/products/duck-canvas-work-pants-totem-prints?variant=58100449476989","img":"images/full/48.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The matching piece of Duck Canvas Chore Jacket, constructed from the same 30oz duck canvas fabric. The boxy, clean fit provides comfortable movement while maintaining a timeless silhouette. • 30oz Duck Canvas","details":["Your note: Cool pattern"],"fabric":null},{"id":49,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Black 3D Check Windcheater Jacket","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Black","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"A windcheater in a textured 3D check.","price":403.0,"colorDetail":"Black 3D check","categoryDetail":"3D check windcheater","url":"https://universalworks.com/en-us/products/black-3d-check-windcheater-jacket","img":"images/full/49.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"A regular‑fit our Windcheater jacket has a two‑way zip front and simple collar. Designed with button‑adjustable cuffs, waist adjuster tabs and three welt pockets. This artisan woven fabric has a raised pile surface creating a 3D check and was made exclusively for us in Southern India, on a 100% cotton hand-loomed base. • Regular fit. • Two-way covered zip. • One piece collar. • Two angled hand pockets. • Single chest welt pocket. • Button adjustable cuffs. • Waist-adjustable button tabs to the rear. • Upper sleeve lining. • Fabric Content: Outer: 100% Cotton. Lining: 100% Cotton. • Washcare: •","details":["Your note: Expensive but cool 3D fabric","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":50,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Ecru 3D Flower NS Bomber Jacket","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"White/Ivory","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"An ecru bomber in a raised flower weave.","price":240.0,"colorDetail":"Ecru 3D flower","categoryDetail":"3D flower bomber jacket","url":"https://universalworks.com/en-us/products/ecru-3d-flower-ns-bomber-jacket","img":"images/full/50.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"NS Bomber jacket is a regular fit bomber with a military feel, complete with arm stash pocket, articulated sleeves, airtex lining, complementary contrast ribs and a popper and zip fastening. Model is 6’0\" with a 37\" chest and a 30.5\" waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. A tufted, 3D flower pattern on a lightweight ecru Khadi cotton base, which is a hand-spun and hand-woven fabric from India. • Regular fit. • Contrast stripe ribbing. • Large hand warmer pockets. • Zipped utility stash pocket on the sleeve. • Partially concealed two-way zip front closure with metal pop studs.","details":["Your note: Expensive but cool 3D fabric","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":51,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Brown Kennedy Stripe Franck Jacket","category":"Suits & Blazers","color":"Brown","occasions":["work","dressy","dance"],"why":"Seersucker jacket to match the Duke pants: an unstructured suit.","price":196.0,"colorDetail":"Brown Kennedy stripe seersucker","categoryDetail":"Franck jacket","url":"https://universalworks.com/en-us/products/brown-kennedy-stripe-franck-jacket","img":"images/full/51.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Franck Jacket blends formal and workwear elements. Purposely cut shorter in length, it is designed with a full button front and a one‑piece collar that takes on a more formal look when worn open. Finished with two front pockets and a single chest pocket. Easy to dress up or down. Model is 6’0\" with a 37\" chest and a 30.5\" waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. A summer classic, an American-style, casual suiting fabric, synonymous with the Preppy look. • Regular fit. • Flat collar. • One front welt and two flap hip pockets. • Fabric Content: 100% Cotton. • Washcare: Wash a","details":["Your note: Would turn my pants into an unstructured suit","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":52,"brand":"Bare Knuckles","retailer":"Bare Knuckles","name":"Javier Wide Leg Jeans","category":"Jeans","color":"Brown","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Wide-leg jeans with a high rise and a roomy hip.","price":250.0,"colorDetail":"Brown","categoryDetail":"Javier wide-leg jeans","url":"https://bareknuckles.co/products/javier-wide-leg-jeans-brown","img":"images/full/52.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Javier in Mocha Brown is a 13 oz midweight stone washed wide leg jean with an untapered fit and a high rise. The pant is assembled PFD white, garment dyed mocha brown, and then stonewashed for a broken in wash and hand. Deep front pocket bags, five-pocket construction with a left coin pocket, five belt loops, gunmetal rivets, two prong donut button fly, and a star motif Jacron back patch.","details":["Your note: Wide jeans with a high rise and roomy hip"],"fabric":null},{"id":53,"brand":"Bare Knuckles","retailer":"Bare Knuckles","name":"Basics Sweatpant","category":"Trousers","color":"Black","occasions":["exercise","hang"],"why":"Wide, high-rise sweats for warm-ups and travel days.","price":160.0,"colorDetail":"Black","categoryDetail":"Wide high-rise sweatpants","url":"https://bareknuckles.co/products/basics-sweatpant-black","img":"images/full/53.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Basics Sweatpant in Aged Black is cut from a 450 gsm brushed cotton fleece. Higher rise with an elastic waist and drawstring closure, deep front pocket bags, a back patch pocket, an elastic cuff at the leg opening, and an extended inseam to let the pant pool at the shoe. For the Aged Black, consider washing before wearing to remove any excess dye.","details":["Your note: Might be the sweatpant I've been wanting"],"fabric":null},{"id":54,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Brown Peached Poplin Dutch Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Brown","occasions":["dance","work","hang"],"why":"Peached poplin in the Dutch cut; soft and light.","price":134.0,"colorDetail":"Brown peached poplin","categoryDetail":"Dutch pants","url":"https://universalworks.com/en-us/products/brown-peached-poplin-dutch-pant","img":"images/full/54.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The Dutch pant is our widest pant. It started, like many of our designs, with a reference, in this case, traditional Dutch sailor trousers, which is where the name comes from. That history gave us a place to begin, but the end result is very much our own, reworked into a modern, everyday fit. The volume comes from stitched-down front darts, giving the leg its shape without feeling heavy or bulky. Waist adjusters, and simple rear patch pockets finish it off. Model is 6’0\" with a 37\" chest and a 30.5\" waist, wearing a size ‘Large' top and size ’32' bottoms. A medium weight poplin with a slightly","details":["Your note: All the fabrics of the dutch pant","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% Cotton"},{"id":55,"brand":"Universal Works","retailer":"Universal Works","name":"Olive Broadcloth Oxford Pant","category":"Trousers","color":"Green","occasions":["dance","work","hang"],"why":"Light broadcloth in a relaxed cut; could be perfect for dancing.","price":164.0,"colorDetail":"Olive broadcloth","categoryDetail":"Oxford pants","url":"https://universalworks.com/en-us/products/olive-broadcloth-oxford-pant","img":"images/full/55.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Oxford pant is a relaxed fit with a single pleat front and a drawstring waist. A wide leg trouser with a slight taper. A fuller and larger shape when compared to our Pleated Track pant. This 100% cotton plain weave is intentionally simple, crisp, breathable, and reliable. A utilitarian shirting fabric with a timeless, understated appeal. • Wide loose leg. • Elasticated and drawstring waist. • Button fly. • Single pleat front. • Two rear pockets: buttoned flap and button jetted. • Two front pockets with internal ticket pocket. • Fabric Content: 100% Cotton. • Washcare: • Please be aware that th","details":["Your note: Oxford pant in size 32 light fabric could be perfect for dancing","100% cotton plain weave is intentionally simple","100% Cotton"],"fabric":"100% cotton plain weave is intentionally simple"},{"id":56,"brand":"Yitai","retailer":"Yitai","name":"SongBird Denim","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","dressy"],"why":"Embroidered boot-cut denim; size up for the hip.","price":120.0,"colorDetail":"Indigo with songbird embroidery","categoryDetail":"Songbird embroidered denim","url":"https://www.yitai.la/products/songbird-denim","img":"images/full/56.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Available in limited quantities for immediate shipping . Light, detailed, and observant. Made from 100% cotton light-wash denim, this pair features embroidered branches and perched songbirds arranged with negative space and movement. The boot cut allows for a relaxed stack that softens the structure of the embroidery. The composition feels natural and airy. Detailed Features 100% Cotton Boot Cut Silhouette Relaxed Fit Full Embroidery Structured Stacking Limited Quantities Fits & Sizing Relaxed Boot Cut Fit Mid-rise 32” inseam Fits true to size. If between sizes, size up. Designed with a 32” in","details":["Your note: they do several embroidered boot cut denim that I could size up on to fit the hip"],"fabric":null},{"id":57,"brand":"Yitai","retailer":"Yitai","name":"Herringbone Selvedge Denim","category":"Jeans","color":"Denim","occasions":["hang","work"],"why":"Herringbone selvedge at a fair price; a 34 fits the hip.","price":160.0,"colorDetail":"Herringbone","categoryDetail":"Herringbone selvedge denim","url":"https://www.yitai.la/products/herringbone-selvedge-denim","img":"images/full/57.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"Limited Quantity available for immediate shipping. Please note that size size 28×30, 30×30, 30x32, 32x30, 32X32, 34X32 ordered after September 16th are estimated to ship by October 20th, 2026. Our Herringbone Selvedge is built on a custom-developed 14 oz. fabric that we spent months refining with the mill. Unlike traditional twill denim, the herringbone weave reverses direction to create its signature zig-zag pattern, adding subtle depth and texture throughout the fabric. Woven from 100% cotton using OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 certified fabric, these jeans are designed to soften, fade, and develop","details":["Your note: pretty cheap for selvedge, have a cool green and a cool herringbone. Would fit the hip in 34"],"fabric":null},{"id":58,"brand":"Indi + Ash","retailer":"Standard & Strange","name":"George Coat -  Handspun Midnight Teal/Iron Black HB","category":"Jackets & Coats","color":"Blue","occasions":["dressy","work"],"why":"Handspun herringbone overcoat; the dressiest thing here.","price":799.0,"colorDetail":"Midnight teal / iron herringbone","categoryDetail":"George coat","url":"https://standardandstrange.com/products/george-coat-handspun-midnight-teal-iron-black-hb?variant=45219167928493","img":"images/full/58.jpg","hi":true,"desc":"The George Coat is a full length overcoat-style garment with a strong shoulder, 3-button placket, and notch lapel. It cuts a very powerful silhouette, with a structured top-half and a very classic, heavy drape as it continues down the body. Warm by virtue of its heft, the George coat makes for an excellent layering piece over other styles, from tee-shirts to suit jackets, the body is cut for comfortable stacking, with room through the sleeves and functional button cuffs too. The fabric is serious — thick, heavy, and handwoven with hand-spun 100% cotton yarns. The outside is an extremely textur","details":["Your note: I mean it's just gorgeous","100% cotton yarns"],"fabric":"100% cotton yarns"}];
